e occupational therapy to enhance motor skills and daily functioning; speech therapy to improve communication and language abilities; special education and individualized learning support for children with diverse needs; Applied Behaviour Analysis (ABA), a behaviour-based intervention for skill development; language and communication therapy to strengthen verbal and social communication; and adult counselling to support parents and caregivers. Rays of Belief Limited was incorporated in 2017 and is headquartered in Gurugram, India. Rays of Belief Limited operates as a subsidiary of Carving Futures Pte. Ltd.","employees":null,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795774833},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795774833,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"RAYS OF BELIEF\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Rays of Belief Ltd. Share Price Today - Rays of Belief Ltd. Stock Price Live NSE/BSE","s":"CNBC TV18","d":1795427940,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxQc0VsTVBkaEVWMGZ4SHhfZ213elc2bzlnRzR5NzJoY0VIRkJodGVCYWZIWWUyc09UbVplZDFMc3hPLVExLVc4bGVkNTc3Z1NlVTdjd0FtT25NV3AydjBKS0dyUFBHUEl2MFJnZWQtLVN2UUFnOUJGbzRfdDRJSHVCR010cw?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Rays of Belief Ltd. IPO Review - Rays of Belief Ltd. IPO Dates, Issue Price, Subscription and Allotment Status","s":"The Economic Times","d":1795044660,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxPWTBhNDU1c0xRTDZORXVneDkyeExrUEJkOVBXei1ndkhmMDRjZHFrZXQ4RUswbUR5cTJKSW5vQnlxQ3J3MEotQ0FERnk1cFdLUTkyc1dEYlVVY1IxOFlrN0dtTm0zR0xLazVWSkpadU9Gc2JUZEUzbVliQ21SYk5RS25FZHV2ajZGU1E?oc=5","g":["plan"]},{"t":"Rays of Belief terminates Medical Director Vivek Gupta after restructuring","s":"scanx.trade","d":1794990350,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxNZ3ZtWm52OWxGZ1VtU3FoTjJzWUdOTm9NUzFCU0dzeEo5M09jd1V6TXhVRkJQX1Z4QmowaDhWNnEwdnpkQlNrbUc5RmtGVER3MlZvWWx1YTdQMHdkUzJvX3p1VjVVYVVMbUpQdFh5UXR4dmZRQ2VwUDYwRUhoQkVCRzRUc2hYZH